{"acknowledgement": "Remove the two self-referential entries an earlier re-pin added. A manifest cannot record its own digest, nor that of the log appended when it is written: each entry is invalidated by the act of writing it, and no edit to those files could ever satisfy verify_manifest.py. The publisher's staging build still hashes both at publish time, so coverage is not lost.", "added": [], "changed": [{"new_sha256": "7f29fa167d0020f84fc9d33666859d93f7129788ae5120767d446d868519d53e", "new_size_bytes": 222245, "old_sha256": "8cfd93230ca7550db1653c7a6c0c57746f4bcde1522e2d9f6b63833ab3fb854c", "old_size_bytes": 211002, "path": "manifest.json"}, {"new_sha256": "a830d248facebf9b8be85eb906048de723f4f24259f81e66274a139c5ddb7d33", "new_size_bytes": 13251, "old_sha256": "852d2190f5039cf48a16dff390da5f0618a9c08d02ae1d0f9e04f42211283c9f", "old_size_bytes": 2363, "path": "manifest_repin_chain.jsonl"}, {"new_sha256": "d59960e130bbdeb9e5b849caaa71d0ce40000208a7c339ffc66d31a0ae5ad51b", "new_size_bytes": 13872, "old_sha256": "da2a59249b5b4535a34f6597dbca74ffdda5d07372181a9597c83aa09c6591c5", "old_size_bytes": 12786, "path": "tools/repin_manifest.py"}], "entry_hash": "9e61b07b3030543328499189e63a37713d713039e3dc0543e57d7e983d4e4dd2", "missing": [], "new_manifest_sha256": "6dcd32d72286a65d70b7481d5c70282fbc790726465ab498418c38695dd5e351", "old_manifest_sha256": "7f29fa167d0020f84fc9d33666859d93f7129788ae5120767d446d868519d53e", "previous_entry_hash": "1b6ae702b0e7b80cb00029ef7b3d07741b7f5df7997566bd9d0b9a0aff1a8167", "schema": "manifest-repin-chain-v1", "timestamp": "2026-10-05T05:09:04.244823+00:00"}
{"acknowledgement": "Correct a test that was itself wrong. test_changed_paths_are_documentation_only_not_code banned .py files, which made the re-pin of the re-pin tooling an error; the laboratory's expected-failure gate caught it rather than a reviewer. Renamed and narrowed to recorded data (.csv/.npz/.db/.sqlite3/.rar), which is the distinction that actually matters: bookkeeping may cover code, evidence may not be rewritten silently. No production code, data, result, or scientific claim changed.", "added": [], "changed": [{"new_sha256": "4330b6d16c34fa8139b5efb56c7a2a48a188d372675c98bf22af8840720b0cd8", "new_size_bytes": 10696, "old_sha256": "23f870d296ffce52e3b984ada727fd00aed63968fda75ef04035b8f5dc84d659", "old_size_bytes": 10280, "path": "tests/unit/test_manifest_repin.py"}], "entry_hash": "b06e62d9b205888651a6ba2587563ddd5f2fb72a1463b94d1a3ce9d9c7c6d2be", "missing": [], "new_manifest_sha256": "407b2bcc81ecff4ef083f2240001d1285242ecf0d1d0c179a419f9c60d7009d2", "old_manifest_sha256": "6dcd32d72286a65d70b7481d5c70282fbc790726465ab498418c38695dd5e351", "previous_entry_hash": "9e61b07b3030543328499189e63a37713d713039e3dc0543e57d7e983d4e4dd2", "schema": "manifest-repin-chain-v1", "timestamp": "2026-10-05T05:13:07.607617+00:00"}
{"acknowledgement": "Fix a CI gate that passed while verifying nothing. tools/verify_superseded_digests.py recovered pre-re-pin bytes by walking 'git log -- manifest.json'; actions/checkout defaults to a shallow clone, so the walk found no commits, every path reported unverifiable, and the tool exited 0. CI run 37320399241 is the proof: it printed 'digest confirmed: 0' and the job was marked successful. Three fixes: detect a shallow clone and fail with the git fetch --unshallow remedy; fail when paths exist but none could be verified, instead of printing SKIP and exiting 0; set fetch-depth: 0 on the integrity job so the history is actually present. No code, data, result, or scientific claim changed -- this is the verification path only.", "added": [], "changed": [{"new_sha256": "7797f14821f26712bc7fce078a2b8aa8c4ec561c915ed537b52d9376ff952e72", "new_size_bytes": 5186, "old_sha256": "157c8ce54baddf53f2820ab63ad5174187054a58e208ddf455b9db2915c787dd", "old_size_bytes": 4623, "path": ".github/workflows/ci.yml"}, {"new_sha256": "4db4e1223880aff91e22fdc9c4c15f565511b92a6cf41e8123525a46f6d216a3", "new_size_bytes": 6969, "old_sha256": "7a5ecdeb3aa5e74b804ed469a30862ca2fc4e3bb94a44fae08ca1d1216780a27", "old_size_bytes": 5227, "path": "tools/verify_superseded_digests.py"}], "entry_hash": "890f4d1fa9e2219a93725c1db3afc07c27317177d53ac36c3494fa49ae14de77", "missing": [], "new_manifest_sha256": "76ad90bb58832aa27c74ac4e41da98dce90a03ac4238968278795c284591d554", "old_manifest_sha256": "407b2bcc81ecff4ef083f2240001d1285242ecf0d1d0c179a419f9c60d7009d2", "previous_entry_hash": "b06e62d9b205888651a6ba2587563ddd5f2fb72a1463b94d1a3ce9d9c7c6d2be", "schema": "manifest-repin-chain-v1", "timestamp": "2026-10-05T14:05:21.602361+00:00"}
